ame<span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><input class="h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 text-sm outline-none ring-0 focus:border-sky-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500 placeholder:text-slate-300" placeholder="Enter your full name" required="" maxLength="40" value=""/></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">Phone Number<span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><input class="h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 text-sm outline-none ring-0 focus:border-sky-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500 placeholder:text-slate-300" placeholder="+91 123 567 8900" required="" value=""/></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">Email<span class="text-red-500">*</span></label><input type="email" class="h-9 w-full rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 text-sm outline-none ring-0 focus:border-sky-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500 placeholder:text-slate-300" placeholder="Enter your email address" required="" maxLength="50" value=""/></div><div class="space-y-1"><label class="block text-xs font-semibold text-slate-700">Your Message<span class="text-red-500">*</span> <span class="font-normal text-slate-500">(Optional)</span></label><div class="relative"><textarea class="min-h-[72px] w-full resize-none rounded-md border border-slate-200 px-3 py-2 pr-14 text-sm outline-none ring-0 focus:border-sky-500 focus:ring-1 focus:ring-sky-500 placeholder:text-slate-300" placeholder="I&#x27;m interested in commercial spaces at Romell Allure. Please share more details" maxLength="200">I&#x27;m interested in commercial spaces at Romell Allure. Please share more details</textarea><span class="absolute bottom-2 right-3 text-[11px] text-slate-400">79<!-- -->/<!-- -->200</span></div></div><button type="submit" disabled="" class="mt-2 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover:opacity-95">G