ry hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/office-for-sale-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">Office Spaces for Sale<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li></ul></div><div><h3 class="mb-3 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-900">Properties for Rent</h3><ul class="space-y-2 text-sm"><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/studio-apartment-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">Studio Apartments for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/1-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">1 BHK Flats for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/2-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">2 BHK Flats for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/3-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">3 BHK Flats for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/4-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">4 BHK Flats for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/5-bhk-flat-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">5 BHK Flats for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/commercial-space-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">Commercial Spaces for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li><li><a class="text-primary hover:underline capitalize" href="/mumbai/office-for-rent-in-romell-allure-borivali-east">Office Spaces for Rent<!-- --> <!-- -->in<!-- --> <!-- -->Romell Allure</a></li></ul></div></div><div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">More about this Location</h2><div class="space-y-2 text-sm text-slate-700"><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Where is Borivali East located in Mumbai?</p><p>Borivali East is a prominent residential and commercial locality situated in the northern part of Mumbai, Maharashtra. It is well-known for its strategic location, offering excellent connectivity to other parts of the city, and is notably close to the expansive Sanjay Gandhi National Park, providing residents with access to green spaces and nature.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">What are the transportation options available in Borivali East?</p><p>Borivali East boasts robust transportation infrastructure. It is a major railway hub with the Borivali railway station on the Western Line. The area also benefits from metro connectivity via the Magathane Metro Station and Borivali East Metro Station. Additionally, an extensive network of BEST buses ensures seamless local and regional travel for commuters.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">What is the lifestyle like in Borivali East?</p><p>Borivali East offers a vibrant and balanced lifestyle, blending urban conveniences with a sense of community. Residents enjoy access to numerous shopping centers, diverse dining options, and recreational spaces like Veer Savarkar Udyan. The presence of reputed educational institutions and healthcare facilities further enhances the quality of life in the locality.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">What are the real estate trends in Borivali East?</p><p>Borivali East is a highly sought-after real estate destination in Mumbai, characterized by consistent demand for residential properties. The area offers a wide range of housing options, from compact 1 BHK apartments to spacious 3 BHK flats. Its robust infrastructure, excellent connectivity, and comprehensive amenities make it an attractive choice for both homebuyers and investors.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">Are there any prominent residential projects in Borivali East?</p><p>Yes, Borivali East features several notable residential projects catering to various preferences. Completed projects include Rustomjee Pinnacle and Samet Sikar Mahal by HARIKO PROPERTIES LLP. Upcoming developments like Apurva Vaishali CHSL by Nakasha Group and Omkareshwar by TRIUMPH VENTURES are also adding modern living spaces to the locality, offering diverse amenities.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">What educational and healthcare facilities are available in Borivali East?</p><p>The locality is well-equipped with reputable educational and healthcare institutions. Prominent schools include St. Francis D&#x27;Assisi High School and St. Francis Institute of Technology (SFIT). For medical needs, residents have access to well-known hospitals such as Apex Hospitals Borivali, Arihant Superspeciality Hospital, and Karuna Hospital, ensuring comprehensive care.</p></div><div><p class="font-medium text-slate-900">What are the key attractions or highlights of Borivali East?</p><p>A major highlight of Borivali East is its close proximity to the Sanjay Gandhi National Park, offering residents a unique opportunity for nature retreats and outdoor activities. The area also features various gardens like Veer Savarkar Udyan and is a bustling commercial hub with diverse shopping, entertainment, and dining options, making it a self-sufficient locality.</p></div></div></div><div class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-100 pt-6"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Explore Projects in Popular Locations near <!-- -->Romell Allure</h2><div class="grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><h3 class="mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">Education</h3><ul class="space-y-1.5 text-sm"><li><p class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2"><span class="font-medium text-slate-700">St Francis Institute Of Technology Sfit Borivali</