 is available for sale in Romell Allure. This property boasts a carpet area of 587 square feet and is located on a higher floor. It includes amenities such as tower parking, a terrace garden with a swimming pool, and a gym. The location is conveniently situated near the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, cinemas, and markets, offering excellent connectivity and essential facilities within reach. The property is currently available for sale, with the price available upon request.\"],\"propertyAddress\":{\"addressLine1\":\"Borivali, near Western Express Highway\",\"city\":\"Mumbai\",\"state\":\"Maharashtra\"},\"projectName\":\"Romell Allure\",\"bedrooms\":2,\"superArea\":587,\"availability\":true,\"geolocation\":{\"type\":\"Point\",\"coordinates\":[72.8661448,19.2367907]},\"dateVerified\":\"2026-07-10T00:39:52.462Z\",\"subscribed\":false,\"planName\":\"Basic\",\"adType\":\"sale\",\"mediaUrl\":\"https://s3.ap-south-1.amazonaws.com/prophunt.prod.fs/listings/6a503f244e3d829ba1dd5560/images/img0.webp\",\"imageCount\":1,\"listingType\":\"listForSale\"}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"id\":\"section-locality\",\"className\":\"min-w-0 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900\",\"children\":\"Locality \u0026 Connectivity\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,1.6fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-slate-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3b\",null,{\"moduleIds\":[\"app/(public)/projects/[slug]/page.tsx -\u003e @/components/discover-map\"]}],[\"$\",\"$L3c\",null,{\"className\":\"h-[288px] min-h-0\",\"center\":{\"lat\":19.2366895,\"lng\":72.8663315},\"markers\":[{\"id\":\"project\",\"lat\":19.2366895,\"lng\":72.8663315,\"title\":\"Romell Allure\"}],\"fitToMarkers\":false,\"zoom\":14}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex max-h-72 flex-col gap-3 overflow-y-au